minios-welcome (6.0.3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Replace the legacy Slides/jQuery frontend with a lightweight static
    welcome page.
  * Generate localized HTML from Lokit-managed i18next catalogs.
  * Add Telegram and GitHub support cards and refresh the top navigation icons.
  * Add Mio as an animated companion with randomized idle activity, recurring
    support reminders, contextual jokes, and useful project tips.
  * Improve Mio playback with seamless double-buffered video transitions and
    passive transition diagnostics.
  * Add localized Mio text for all supported languages and expand translation
    tests.
  * Add compact alpha WebM runtime assets while keeping raw authoring videos out
    of Debian source packages.
  * Keep runtime Mio assets in source packages so clean rebuilds are complete.

